      <td style="padding-left:2px;padding-right:4px">${ok === null ? '' : ok ? '<span class="badge good">ok</span>' : '<span class="badge bad">off</span>'}</td></tr>`;
  }).join('');
  const T = pr.T;
  return `<div class="head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Period ${R()} · step 2</span><h2>Rations</h2>
  <p>Formulate the ration on a dry-matter basis. Prices are this period's delivered prices per ton as fed. Tick the ingredients you want to use and enter each one's share of the dry matter; the mix must total 100%. The analysis updates as you type and is checked against the targets on the right. The prediction is for the pen's average lamb at steady state; the first week after a change will differ as gut fill and intake adjust.</p></div></div>
